# grok-login-chat.mjs — point the login+chat card at a REAL Supabase project.
# Copy to `.env.local` (gitignored) and fill in. With NONE of these set, the test
# runs against an in-process stub (GoTrue + a grok endpoint) — no real creds needed.
#
# The project id / URL / anon key + the username & password live ONLY here (never
# committed, never a hard-coded cel). The xAI/provider key is NOT here — it lives
# server-side in the edge function the GROK_CHAT_URL points at.

# CCFR_PROJECT=ccfr
# CCFR_URL=https://YOUR-PROJECT-REF.supabase.co
# CCFR_ANONKEY=sb_publishable_xxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxx
# CCFR_EMAIL=you@example.com
# CCFR_PASSWORD=your-password
# GROK_CHAT_URL=https://YOUR-PROJECT-REF.supabase.co/functions/v1/grok
